Every file in this directory is redistributed from a third party. The ECI files
define the cluster-expansion energies (through the tables in data/); the
metadynamics files are used only for comparison.

Source:

    J. Damewood, D. Schwalbe-Koda and R. Gomez-Bombarelli,
    "Sampling lattices in semi-grand canonical ensemble with autoregressive
    machine learning", npj Computational Materials 8, 61 (2022).
    doi:10.1038/s41524-022-00736-4
    https://github.com/learningmatter-mit/Segal

Files:

    ECI_CuAu_Final_Submission.json          CuAu effective cluster interactions
    agpd_dft_eci_final_submission.json      AgPd effective cluster interactions
    CuAu_128_ref_meta_data_final_submission.npy   metadynamics F(x, T), CuAu 128
    AgPd_125_ref_meta_data_final_submission.npy   metadynamics F(x, T), AgPd 125
    plotter_concs_final_submission.csv      published phase-boundary compositions
    plotter_temps_final_submission.csv      published phase-boundary temperatures

